  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "噼帕！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C5E15FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡帕，怎么了？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你很在意<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>身上的东西吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15E15FF0C600E4E484E86FF1F00100001BE01000A4F605F885728610F00100002010000008EAB4E0A76844E1C897F5417FF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦……？\n那糖果是……？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E620262026FF1F000A90A37CD6679C662F20262026FF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噼里啪啦糖果",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C91CC556A55667CD6679C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要尝尝吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815C1D5C1D5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然嘴里噼里啪啦的\n会有点让人害怕，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不过吃了之后似乎会长见识啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D7136563491CC567C91CC556A55667684000A4F1A670970B98BA94EBA5BB36015FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D8FC754034E864E4B540E4F3C4E4E4F1A957F89C18BC6554A300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我来品尝一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211676554C15C1D4E004E0B5427300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有种预感，美味的甜甜圈要问世了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670979CD9884611FFF0C7F8E54737684751C751C5708898195EE4E164E86300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n请你稍等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8BF74F607A0D7B494E004E0B300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "完成了！\n这是新的甜甜圈食谱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8C62104E86FF01000A8FD9662F65B07684751C751C570898DF8C31300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜：40以上\n辣：200以上<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n酸：400以上<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n苦：280以上<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n鲜：40以上。麻烦你以这个食谱为准。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751CFF1A003400304EE54E0A000A8FA3FF1A0032003000304EE54E0A00100001BE00000A9178FF1A0034003000304EE54E0A00100001BE00000A82E6FF1A0032003800304EE54E0A00100001BE00000A9C9CFF1A003400304EE54E0A30029EBB70E64F604EE58FD94E2A98DF8C314E3A51C6300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要做新的甜甜圈，\n就来和我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C8981505A65B07684751C751C5708FF0C000A5C316765548C62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "灵感来源于噼里啪啦糖果，\n刺激的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>等离子闪电甜甜圈<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>做好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7075611F67656E904E8E567C91CC556A55667CD6679CFF0C000A523A6FC0768400100002FF0000067B4979BB5B5095EA7535751C751C570800100002FF000000505A597D4E86FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让胡帕吃掉后，\n能前往什么样的异次元密阿雷呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA980E15E1554036389540EFF0C000A80FD524D5F804EC04E48683776845F026B2151435BC6963F96F75462FF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有急事！\n快点来<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>密阿雷南站前<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670960254E8BFF01000A5FEB70B9676500100002FF0000065BC6963F96F753577AD9524D00100002FF0000005427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来又要发生不妙的事了，\n不过有你在就没问题！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676553C8898153D1751F4E0D599976844E8B4E86FF0C000A4E0D8FC767094F6057285C316CA195EE9898FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是连你都没见过的\n异次元扭洞对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F8FDE4F6090FD6CA189C18FC77684000A5F026B215143626D6D1E5BF95427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第一次见到",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C4E006B2189C152300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是黄色的啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F9EC482727684554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不知道里面会有什么样的宝可梦，\n所以才把你叫来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D77E5905391CC97624F1A67094EC04E48683776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A62404EE5624D628A4F6053EB6765300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能帮我个忙吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD5E2E62114E2A5FD95417FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我检测到了一个很离谱的扭洞！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n里面应该有不得了的宝可梦。\n要是它失控超级进化了，可就不得了啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n拜托老3位去调查一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621168C06D4B52304E864E004E2A5F8879BB8C317684626D6D1EFF0100100001BE01000A91CC97625E948BE567094E0D5F974E8676845B9D53EF68A63002000A8981662F5B83593163A78D857EA78FDB53164E86FF0C53EF5C314E0D5F974E865566300200100001BE00000A62DC6258800100334F4D53BB8C0367E54E004E0B5427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那位超级进化小姐姐和\n队长那边就由我来通知好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F4D8D857EA78FDB53165C0F59D059D0548C000A961F957F90A38FB95C31753162116765901A77E5597D4E86300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了，地点在\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>密阿雷南站前<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF0C573070B95728000A00100002FF0000065BC6963F96F753577AD9524D00100002FF000000300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就在那里",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C31572890A391CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道在哪里",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E59053572854EA91CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真是个有趣的家伙啊！\n好呐，交给你了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F662F4E2A67098DA376845BB64F19554AFF01000A597D5450FF0C4EA47ED94F604E86FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个乌羽啊，\n说不定很适合当市长之类的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A4E4C7FBD554AFF0C000A8BF44E0D5B9A5F88900254085F535E02957F4E4B7C7B76845462300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可尔妮在此登场！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF5C1459AE57286B64767B573AFF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>说<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他一时半会来不了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100002018B00018BF400100003110000FF010159794ED64E0065F6534A4F1A67654E0D4E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，由我们两个来挑战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C753162114EEC4E244E2A6765631162185427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可尔妮，\n如果缺人的话，我可以顶上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF5C1459AEFF0C000A5982679C7F3A4EBA76848BDDFF0C621153EF4EE598764E0A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛琪艾儿！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B742A827E513FFF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在超级甜甜圈大作战开始之前，\n我们在异次元密阿雷见过面。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288D857EA7751C751C570859274F5C62185F0059CB4E4B524DFF0C000A62114EEC57285F026B2151435BC6963F96F789C18FC79762300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你也是个本领高强的\n超级进化训练家对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E5F662F4E2A672C98869AD85F3A7684000A8D857EA78FDB53168BAD7EC35BB65BF95427FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就这么定了～！\n这次就由我们3个来挑战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318FD94E485B9A4E86FF5EFF01000A8FD96B215C31753162114EEC00334E2A676563116218FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n等你准备好了，就告诉我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A7B494F6051C65907597D4E86FF0C5C31544A8BC962115427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要进去吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818FDB53BB5417FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "进入异次元密阿雷",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDB51655F026B2151435BC6963F96F70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "做准备",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "505A51C659070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟这个三人组是头一次搭档，\n还是仔细准备一下比较好啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF8FD94E2A4E094EBA7EC4662F59344E006B21642D6863FF0C000A8FD8662F4ED47EC651C659074E004E0B6BD48F83597D554A300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我随时都没问题！\n毕竟这是为了守护密阿雷的和平嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211968F65F690FD6CA195EE9898FF01000A6BD57ADF8FD9662F4E3A4E865B8862A45BC6963F96F77684548C5E73561B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，等一下！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你的盒子满了，\n这样是不能捉宝可梦的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C7B494E004E0BFF0100100001BE01000A4F60768476D25B506EE14E86FF0C000A8FD96837662F4E0D80FD63495B9D53EF68A67684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是个侦探，所以我知道。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要去特殊的异次元密阿雷，\n就需要特殊的甜甜圈！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E2A4FA663A2FF0C62404EE5621177E59053300200100001BE01000A898153BB72796B8A76845F026B2151435BC6963F96F7FF0C000A5C319700898172796B8A7684751C751C5708FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奥拉！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596562C9FF01FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最强的电属性宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果它失控超级进化了的话，\n我无法想象事情会发展成什么样。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67005F3A768475355C5E60275B9D53EF68A62026202600100001BE01000A5982679C5B83593163A78D857EA78FDB53164E8676848BDDFF0C000A621165E06CD560F38C614E8B60C54F1A53D15C5562104EC04E486837300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "连你这么厉害的训练家\n都感受到威胁了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDE4F608FD94E4853895BB376848BAD7EC35BB6000A90FD611F53D752305A0180C14E865417FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E484F1A300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是高兴得不得了。\n正盼着能和强敌一战呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F9AD851745F974E0D5F974E863002000A6B6376FC774080FD548C5F3A654C4E0062185462FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然，我们会好好平息它的\n失控超级进化，帮它脱离困境的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136FF0C62114EEC4F1A597D597D5E73606F5B837684000A593163A78D857EA78FDB5316FF0C5E2E5B83813179BB56F058837684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "周围的超级能浓度\n正在极速上升！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n警告！你所确认的个体\n即将失控超级进化！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "546856F476848D857EA780FD6D535EA6000A6B6357286781901F4E0A5347FF0100100001BE01000A8B66544AFF014F606240786E8BA476844E2A4F53000A53735C06593163A78D857EA78FDB5316FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕奥！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54955965FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n捉住捷拉奥拉吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A63494F4F637762C9596562C95427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奥拉真是强得没话说。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596562C9771F662F5F3A5F976CA18BDD8BF4300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奥拉简直像是在寻找对战对手一样，\n有时候会出现在街头，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n甚至还当起了保镖。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596562C97B8076F450CF662F57285BFB627E5BF962185BF9624B4E006837FF0C000A670965F650194F1A51FA73B0572888575934FF0C00100001BE00000A751A81F38FD85F538D774E864FDD9556300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "会不会就是它追求强大的心\n导致了这个异次元密阿雷的诞生呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F1A4E0D4F1A5C31662F5B838FFD6C425F3A592776845FC3000A5BFC81F44E868FD94E2A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848BDE751F5462FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，\n让我们回到平常的密阿雷吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C000A8BA962114EEC56DE52305E735E3876845BC6963F96F75427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>和可尔妮，\n你们一直以来就是这样保护密阿雷的啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000548C53EF5C1459AEFF0C000A4F604EEC4E0076F44EE567655C31662F8FD968374FDD62A45BC6963F96F77684554A300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的辛苦你们了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F76848F9B82E64F604EEC4E86FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我才应该好好谢谢你！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是没有你，\n我们就没办法让捷拉奥拉镇静下来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211624D5E948BE5597D597D8C228C224F60FF0100100001BE01000A8981662F6CA167094F60FF0C000A62114EEC5C316CA1529E6CD58BA9637762C9596562C9954797594E0B6765300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉！\n我来晚了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49FF01000A62116765665A4E86300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对不起，\n让你们久等了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E0D8D77FF0C000A8BA94F604EEC4E457B494E865427FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "已经结束了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DF27ECF7ED3675F4E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？\n玛琪艾儿，你怎么在这里？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F000A739B742A827E513FFF0C4F60600E4E4857288FD991CCFF1F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？\n玛琪艾儿，你怎么在这里？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F000A739B742A827E513FFF0C4F60600E4E4857288FD991CCFF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我在异次元密阿雷\n替你出了一份力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621157285F026B2151435BC6963F96F7000A66FF4F6051FA4E864E004EFD529BFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "从今往后，\n我们才是最强3人组啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECE4ECA5F80540EFF0C000A62114EEC624D662F67005F3A00334EBA7EC45566300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是吧～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F5427FF5EFF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦～！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF5EFF01FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
  ],
